# gh's telemetry device id, written here rather than under LOCALAPPDATA when
# gh runs with a stripped environment (some sandboxed shells drop it). Stray,
# but it has to be ignored: release_preflight refuses to tag on any untracked
# file, so this would block a release rather than merely add noise.
.local/

# Clean-room test rooms (make cleanroom). They live in the checkout so
# they are findable, and are kept out of git because a room is scratch:
# a bundle copy, a transcript and one action. `git add -f` a room whose
# QUESTIONS.md is worth keeping.
cleanroom/
